v
1) All numbers used in tables are calculated using a correction factor for each enumeration area. The correction factor technique is 
used to adjust for populations and household counts for areas that may have coverage issues. The application 
of correction factors resulted in numbers  having decimal numbers and the rounding of the numbers may result 
in slight difference in totals. 
2) For values that are too small or few cases, further disagregation may not be possible to avoid having to 
reveal any identity, in line with provisions of the statisticis act. Tables that cannot fit in one page continue in 
another
3) This is the second version to the volume 1, released during  the official release with additional  tables. The 
tables are downloadable from the website in pdf and excel format More information 
For more information about the Vanuatu 2020 National Population and Housing Census, or to request additional 
statistical information from the census not published in this summary publication, please contact the Vanuatu National 
Statistics Office (VNSO): 
